// The health server of this build: the gateway at health.jamesgornet.com,
// in front of Open Health Sync. Committed.
//
// With an address here, the Health access page signs in to that server, the
// wearables connect through it, and Apple Health uploads to it. Empty keeps
// the Soma behaviour: wearables through the account's `ohs` function.
// "//" starts a comment in an xcconfig, so the address is written with an
// empty $() between the slashes; Xcode joins it back to https://...
HEALTH_SERVER_URL = https:/$()/health.jamesgornet.com
